# Compiled twins of the TypeScript sources.
#
# `tsc` without an `outDir` emits a `.js` file next to every `.ts`/`.tsx`
# file. Vite and Vitest resolve `.js` *before* `.tsx`, so a stray emitted
# file silently shadows the real source. Never commit these.
src/**/*.js